# m_ap applies a function to each item and boxes every result (B14), so
# a function giving an array can be mapped; e_ach stays for functions
# giving one value each.
== SOURCE
t_ally 'r_ange m_ap 1 2 3
d_isclose 3 s_elect 'r_ange m_ap 1 2 3
'{ r_ev d_isclose _r } m_ap "ab" "cde"
'{ t_ally d_isclose _r } e_ach 'r_ange m_ap 1 2 3
== TYPE
Int
Int
Box Char
Int
== RESULT
3
1 2 3
┌→───────────┐
│ ┌→─┐ ┌→──┐ │
│ │ba│ │edc│ │
│ └──┘ └───┘ │
└∊───────────┘
1 2 3
